{"descriptionModels":[{"description":"Prerequisite: Dragonborn\n\nNote: This feat is intended to be used instead of the Dragon Wings feat\n\nSomething awakens in the core of your bloodline, sprouting draconic wings and increasing your physical capacities. You gain the following benefits:\n\n- You gain a flying speed equal to your movement speed that you can use if you aren\u0027t wearing heavy armor and aren\u0027t exceeding your carrying capacity. Medium or light armor must be made to acommodate your wings. If you are already benefiting from another flying speed, add the speed given by this feat to that one.\n\n- Increase your Strength, Constitution, or Dexterity score by 1, up to a maximum of 20.","level":1}],"id":"dragon_wings","isFeature":false,"jsonType":"feat","level":1,"name":"Dragon Flight [SM]","notes":"","type":"Feat"}